<h4>Additional Information</h4>
<ul>
<li>TMM was the method used to normalise library sizes.</li>
<li>The edgeR likelihood ratio test was used.</li>
<li>MD-Plot highlighted genes are significant at FDR of 0.05 and exhibit log2-fold-change of at least 0.</li>
</ul>
